# CODEOWNERS
# Defines who is automatically requested to review PRs touching specific paths.
# Place this file at .bitbucket/CODEOWNERS or the repo root.
# Docs: https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/set-up-and-use-code-owners/

# Default owner for everything not matched below
* @your-workspace/team-name

# Claude and AI config — reviewed by whoever owns the AI tooling
CLAUDE.md @your-workspace/team-name
PROJECT_REF.md @your-workspace/team-name
.claude/ @your-workspace/team-name
.mcp.json @your-workspace/team-name

# CI — reviewed by whoever owns DevOps
bitbucket-pipelines.yml @your-workspace/devops

# Security-sensitive files
.env.example @your-workspace/team-lead
**/auth/** @your-workspace/team-lead
**/security/** @your-workspace/team-lead

# Documentation
docs/ @your-workspace/team-name
*.md @your-workspace/team-name

# Source code — replace with your actual structure
src/ @your-workspace/team-name
